# Graft quality loop

When changing Graft handlers, routing, replies, or operator English: **loop the full set until one pass produces zero fixes.** If any layer fails or finds a real bug, fix it, then restart from the top. Do not stop after a single green layer.

## One pass (in this order)

1. **Self-check** — re-read changed parsers/gates; look for false-success (`### Done` with no save), missing `contextService.getDashboardUid()`, handler order in `ChatInterface.tsx`, read-only questions blocked as unmatched jobs.
2. **Jest** — `npm run test:regression` plus operator paraphrase files. Always run a **new random paraphrase set**:
   ```bash
   GRAFT_PARAPHRASE_SEED=$RANDOM npm run test:regression
   GRAFT_PARAPHRASE_SEED=$RANDOM npx jest --watchAll=false --runInBand --forceExit \
     src/services/regression/operatorParaphraseRegression.test.ts
   ```
   Add the operator’s **exact** failing prompt to `graftRegressionFixtures.ts` when one fails.
3. **Bugbot** — `/review-bugbot` on **branch changes** (or uncommitted if not committed yet). High/medium findings are blockers. Informational-only is not a restart.
4. **Commit** remaining product/test/rule fixes (not secrets). Deploy needs a clean tree except the script’s own build bump.
5. **Deploy** — `./scripts/deploy-electramet.sh` (sandbox EC2). Note the new **build** number.
6. **Playwright** (not “playing”) against that build:
   ```bash
   GRAFANA_E2E=1 GRAFANA_E2E_MUTATING=1 GRAFANA_MIN_BUILD=<deployed> \
   npm run test:regression:e2e:mutating
   ```
   Never paste Grafana passwords into chat. Mutating tests must clean up (`removeE2ePanelsIfPresent`).

## Stop condition

Stop only when **all six** succeeded **and** that pass did not require another code, test, or rule change. A deploy-metadata-only commit after a green Playwright is allowed and does **not** by itself restart the loop.

❌ BAD: Jest green → deploy → skip Playwright because “it passed last time”
✅ GOOD: Jest (new paraphrase seed) + Bugbot + deploy + Playwright, then stop because nothing else failed
